        "question": "How big will my Goldendoodle get?",
        "answer": "All of our puppies are Micro & Miniature Goldendoodles and should be 10-25 lbs when fully grown."
      },
      {
        "question": "Are your parent dogs health tested?",
        "className": "",
        "answer": "Yes, absolutely. All of our parent dogs, including Maggie and Casi, are Embark DNA and genetically health tested to ensure the best possible start for each puppy."
      },
      {
        "className": "",
        "question": "How much are your puppies and what is the deposit?",
        "answer": "Our puppies are generally around $3,500. There is a $500 non-refundable deposit which secures your place on the waitlist and is applied towards the final purchase price."
